<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS5.SSS3" title="In 4.5 Ablation Studies ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ SeGPruner: Semantic–Geometric Visual Token Pruner for 3D Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.5.3 </span>Inference speedup</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS6" title="In 4 Experiments ‣ SeGPruner: Semantic–Geometric Visual Token Pruner for 3D Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.6 </span>Qualitative Results.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In SeGPruner: Semantic–Geometric Visual Token Pruner for 3D Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
